    "Charges to 100%, holds for an hour, discharges to 15% while plugged in, then charges to 100% again before returning to your limit. Takes about half a day and adds about one charge cycle. Macs with Apple silicon generally don't need manual calibration." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "充至 100% 并保持 1 小时，插电放至 15%，再次充至 100% 并保持后回到上限。约需半天，增加约一个充放电循环。Apple Silicon Mac 通常不需要手动校准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
