    "Hachibu keeps its own limit while it runs. Choose what happens when it quits below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hachibu 运行期间使用自己的上限，退出后的处理可在下方选择。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hachibu sets the charge limit while it runs, and changes made in System Settings are reverted. Below 80%, System Settings shows a 0% limit; the limit shown in Hachibu is the one in effect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hachibu 运行期间管理充电上限，系统设置中的改动会被改回。低于 80% 时，系统设置会显示 0% 上限，请以 Hachibu 显示的上限为准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
