    "Hold Current Charge temporarily sets the system limit to the current level (up to 99%) so the charger powers your Mac. Your limit is restored when you unplug, switch back, or quit Hachibu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择“保持当前电量”时，插电且电量高于上限会把系统上限临时改成当前电量（最高 99%），由充电器给电脑供电；拔电、改回“放电到上限”或退出 Hachibu 时恢复你设置的上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holding at %lld%%" : {
