      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留当前上限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your Mac plugged in. Calibration takes about half a day and adds about one charge cycle. It continues from discharging to 15%, then charges to 100% again before returning to your limit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请保持 Mac 接入电源。校准约需半天，增加约一个充放电循环。将从放电至 15% 开始，再充至 100% 并保持后回到上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep your Mac plugged in. Calibration takes about half a day; discharging to 15%% while plugged in can take 5 to 8 hours when the Mac is idle. It starts from step %lld. If you quit Hachibu, your limit is restored and you can continue later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请保持 Mac 接入电源。校准约需半天，空闲时插电放至 15%% 可能需要 5–8 小时。将从第 %lld 步开始。退出 Hachibu 时会恢复上限，下次可继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
