      }
    },
    "Calibration needs the background item to discharge to 15%." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "校准需要后台组件将电量放至 15%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calibration paused. Approve the Hachibu background item in Login Items to continue." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "校准已暂停，请在“登录项”中批准 Hachibu 后台组件后继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Charge limits below 80% and battery calibration need a background item that runs as root. It can only change the charge limit. After installing, approve Hachibu in System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions. Until then, Hachibu uses 80%." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "低于 80% 的上限和电池校准需要以 root 运行的后台组件，它只能修改充电上限。安装后，请在“系统设置 → 通用 → 登录项与扩展”中批准 Hachibu。批准前仍按 80% 执行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not safely remove the background item. Check the charge limit and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未能安全移除后台组件。请检查充电上限后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hachibu first returns the charge limit to 80% or higher, then removes the background item. Limits below 80% and calibration will no longer be available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hachibu 会先将充电上限恢复至 80% 或更高，再移除后台组件。移除后将无法使用低于 80% 的上限和校准功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
